    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split image. On the left, a faded, slightly pixelated image of a vintage Myspace profile screen with 'Top 8 friends' section visible, overlaid with a subtle, glowing musical note icon. On the right, a modern, minimalist smartphone screen displaying a blurred, overwhelming feed of notifications and app icons, with a stylized, subtly tired-looking human eye emoji peeking from behind. The overall composition should be clean, professional, and evoke both nostalgia and modern digital fatigue, using a muted color palette with strategic pops of light. The image should be designed as a header for a news article, with space for a headline.",
