    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual digital art image representing global geopolitical tension and market volatility. The core visual should feature a stylized, abstract rendering of the Earth being squeezed or pressured by two opposing, shadowy hands labeled 'US' and 'Iran'. Below, a jagged, downward-trending red stock market graph pierces through the base of the Earth. Oil derricks or an oil barrel icon should be subtly visible near the tension points, emitting a faint, dark smoke. The background should be a chaotic swirl of muted blues, grays, and deep reds, suggesting global instability. Incorporate faint, abstract outlines of world map continents, with a subtle highlight over India, United States, and the Middle East, without being overly literal. The overall mood should be tense and uncertain, using a dark, moody color palette with sharp contrasts.",
